    "Opens a small input bar over any app. Press ↩ to ask, and the answer appears in a compact window that stays on top. Press the shortcut again to hide it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在任何应用中弹出一个小输入框。按 ↩ 提问，回答会显示在置顶的小窗口中。再按一次快捷键即可隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
